```mermaid
flowchart TD
    start([Start with one CUSP observation row])

    reported{Does the source report a row-specific observation limit?}
    keep_reported[Keep reported obs_limit\nFlags: none unless source-specific caveat applies]

    presence{Is permafrost observed?}
    measured_presence{Does the row have measured pf_depth or thaw_depth?}
    presence_blank[obs_limit may remain blank\nObserved depth carries the key information\nFlags: none for obs_limit]
    presence_review[Review source\nPresence without depth or limit is under-specified\nPossible flags: OA or draft OL]

    absence_depth{Does the absence row contain a measured depth?}
    row_depth[Use row measured depth as obs_limit]
    row_depth_flag[Flags: PB if profile-bottom absence\nor OA if interpreted observation limit]

    source_protocol{Does source documentation give a protocol,\ninstrument, or profile limit?}
    protocol_limit[Use documented source/protocol limit]
    protocol_flag[Flags: OA for assumed protocol limit\nor PB for profile-bottom absence]

    same_method{Does the same source and method have\npositive pf_depth/thaw_depth values that bound the data domain?}
    max_depth[Use conservative max observed depth\nwithin the same source and method]
    max_depth_flag[Flags: OA\nDocument source-specific rationale]

    unresolved{Can a defensible limit be inferred another way?}
    custom_rule[Apply documented source-specific rule\nFlags: OA/PB/other source-specific flags]
    keep_unresolved[Keep only with unresolved-limit caveat\nor defer/drop from canonical release\nPossible flag: draft OL]

    output([Output row with obs_limit decision\nand quality_flags])

    start --> reported
    reported -- yes --> keep_reported --> output
    reported -- no --> presence

    presence -- yes --> measured_presence
    measured_presence -- yes --> presence_blank --> output
    measured_presence -- no --> presence_review --> unresolved

    presence -- no --> absence_depth
    absence_depth -- yes --> row_depth --> row_depth_flag --> output
    absence_depth -- no --> source_protocol

    source_protocol -- yes --> protocol_limit --> protocol_flag --> output
    source_protocol -- no --> same_method

    same_method -- yes --> max_depth --> max_depth_flag --> output
    same_method -- no --> unresolved

    unresolved -- yes --> custom_rule --> output
    unresolved -- no --> keep_unresolved --> output

    classDef decision fill:#eef8f6,stroke:#173b3a,stroke-width:1px,color:#173b3a;
    classDef action fill:#fff,stroke:#d7e5e3,stroke-width:1px,color:#173b3a;
    classDef caution fill:#fff5e8,stroke:#b45f1b,stroke-width:1px,color:#173b3a;

    class reported,presence,measured_presence,absence_depth,source_protocol,same_method,unresolved decision;
    class keep_reported,presence_blank,row_depth,row_depth_flag,protocol_limit,protocol_flag,max_depth,max_depth_flag,custom_rule action;
    class presence_review,keep_unresolved caution;
```
